      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NICCIMOTA (5) bolted in fresh before a 1L defeat as the race favourite over this track and trip a fortnight ago. She steps up in grade today, though drops a stack of weight and that's important with her racing pattern. Will be tough to catch with no weight on her back. SWINGMAN (4) couldn't hold on last start ween leading over this track and trip, beaten 0.5L when gunned down late. The winkers replace the blinkers now and he'll give himself every chance from up on the speed. Can be in this for a very long way. DEVINE BELIEF (1) only had one run last campaign where she was solid in what ended up being a hot form race. She'll be fitter for a recent trial and her first-up record is very strong. Maps beautifully and looks a major player. PIN DEEP (3) is hard to knock on his recent form and a return to his best will see him hard to hold out. AVOIDANCE (2) can feature first-up.",
